invariant: INV-73
file: src/session.c
catches: tcp_nonblocking_loop_test
reason: tlsi_give_back_buf forgets the pointer and keeps buf_written_len,
  so a session that gave its buffer back still names a length of bytes
  it holds. The loop test requires the mark to be 0 once each end
  connected (docs/decisions.md 249).

--- old
    t->buf_written_len = 0;
--- new
